// RFC 0016 K4 "Families match ports": UnlitGeneric in the combos the core's
// `unlit` family claims (base texture, $color and $alpha, vertex color and
// alpha, alpha test, translucent and additive blending). The legacy port
// draws them (run with --extra-arg=-vklegacyvertexlit; its pixels are judged
// against the retail D3D9 bytecode) and records the port pixels the family
// suite compares with (tools/render/family_port_pixels.py). Quads are in clip
// space (identity transforms). Detail textures and env maps are not claimed
// by the family yet; their cases stay in ../vertexlitgeneric.vdf.
